  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup almond flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon xanthan gum",
    "2 tablespoon butter (frozen)",
    "2 large egg white",
    "12 ounce breakfast sausage",
    "1 teaspoon xanthan gum",
    "1 cup chicken broth",
    "1/2 teaspoon onion powder",
    "1 teaspoon black pepper",
    "salt (to taste)",
    "1/2 cup half-and-half"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, whisk together the almond flour, baking powder, and xanthan gum listed in biscuit ingredient list.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grate the frozen (or very cold) butter. Alternately, if no grater is available, dice it into small cubes. Mix into the flour mixture with a fork until it resembles coarse crumbs. Set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate medium-sized bowl, beat the egg whites to stiff peaks.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently fold the egg whites into the flour mixture with a rubber spatula until just combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chill the biscuit mixture in the refrigerator while making the gravy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large skillet, brown the sausage over medium heat, stirring often to scramble the meat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the sausage to a paper towel lined plate to drain the excess grease, reserving most of the fat left in the skillet.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn the heat to medium-low and sprinkle the xanthan gum from the gravy ingredient list into the grease, whisking constantly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook the xanthan gum for about a minute until lightly browned.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in the chicken stock, onion powder and black pepper. Bring to a simmer and allow the gravy to thicken, about 5 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in the half and half and continue to simmer until the gravy is thick and creamy, about another 3 minutes. Taste at this time and add salt if needed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir the cooked sausage into gravy and remove from the heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-14.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375F. Pour the sausage gravy into a casserole dish. Drop the biscuit mixture on top of the gravy in small spoonfuls, distributing as evenly as possible. The mixture will be thick.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/sausage-biscuit-bake-15.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 18-20 minutes until hot, bubbly, and the biscuits are baked and browned.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-sausage-gravy-and-biscuit-bake/#wprm-recipe-52551-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
